WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.112 --> 00:00:05.768
- I'm a normal guy, a simple guy,

00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:07.551
but I'm going to change the world.

00:00:07.551 --> 00:00:09.757
I lost my wife in 95,

00:00:09.757 --> 00:00:13.356
was alone with four children, no money.

00:00:13.356 --> 00:00:17.523
The only thing that I found
relief in was in cold water

00:00:21.018 --> 00:00:22.703
and breathing exercises.

00:00:22.703 --> 00:00:24.434
I'm a messenger, by the way.

00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:26.351
I'm a man on a mission.

00:00:27.413 --> 00:00:30.990
And I don't stop until
we have no war anymore,

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.224
no disease and no depression.

00:00:33.224 --> 00:00:34.351
Yes.

00:00:34.351 --> 00:00:36.601
(clapping)

00:00:38.374 --> 00:00:40.957
(upbeat music)

00:00:46.758 --> 00:00:47.850
