here in Toronto, Canada.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:53.299
I'm about to go do Wim
Hof's full day seminar

00:00:53.299 --> 00:00:56.146
on breathing and ice baths.

00:00:56.146 --> 00:00:57.995
I'm excited and I'm nervous for it.

00:00:57.995 --> 00:00:59.651
We're going to hopefully have a
chance to talk to Wim as well,

00:00:59.651 --> 00:01:01.379
and learn about his story.

00:01:01.379 --> 00:01:03.138
It's May 20 when I'm recording this,

00:01:03.138 --> 00:01:05.632
my birthday, and so we're
going to see what Wim

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:09.799
has to offer and hopefully
have fun in the cold bath.

00:01:10.724 --> 00:01:13.474
(peaceful music)

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:47.390
- Nice to meet you.

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:48.449
Nice to meet you.

00:01:48.449 --> 00:01:49.671
Hello.

00:01:49.671 --> 00:01:52.174
- [Man] We are ready for a great day.

00:01:52.174 --> 00:01:53.503
That's the ice pool.

00:01:53.503 --> 00:01:54.504
- [Wim] That's the ice pool.

00:01:54.504 --> 00:01:55.806
That's the pool.

00:01:55.806 --> 00:01:56.911
- Wow.

00:01:56.911 --> 00:01:58.417
- [Wim] It's just getting going.

00:01:58.417 --> 00:01:59.604
Get everyone.

00:01:59.604 --> 00:02:00.604
- I love it.

00:02:07.998 --> 00:02:09.611
- Yes, yes.

00:02:09.611 --> 00:02:11.861
Let's make it a good story.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:19.957
- We live in a world
where there's all kinds

00:02:19.957 --> 00:02:22.675
of false healers and fake
alternative medicine programs

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:25.840
you can sign up for, it's
a rare moment in history

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:29.455
when someone comes along who
can perform real miracles

00:02:29.455 --> 00:02:31.802
with real evidence to back them up.

00:02:31.802 --> 00:02:35.593
Wim Hof has defied logic
time and time again

00:02:35.593 --> 00:02:38.328
and always under scientific scrutiny.

00:02:38.328 --> 00:02:40.573
He holds the world record for being able

00:02:40.573 --> 00:02:43.755
to be submerged in ice
for almost two hours

00:02:43.755 --> 00:02:45.281
without his core body
temperature changing.

00:02:45.281 --> 00:02:48.014
He's climbed Mount Everest in
nothing but a pair of shorts,

00:02:48.014 --> 00:02:51.375
and run a marathon in the desert
without drinking any water.

00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:53.975
He's even proven in a laboratory setting

00:02:53.975 --> 00:02:57.244
that he can withstand illnesses
using the power of his mind.

00:02:57.244 --> 00:02:59.946
But he's not a freak of nature.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.938
According to Wim, anyone
can do what he can do.

00:03:02.938 --> 00:03:04.832
They just have to learn his method,

00:03:04.832 --> 00:03:06.991
the Wim Hof method.

00:03:06.991 --> 00:03:10.537
Using a combination of cold
immersion, breathing techniques,

00:03:10.537 --> 00:03:14.983
and mental focus, anyone
can accomplish feats

00:03:14.983 --> 00:03:17.706
that were previously
thought to be impossible.

00:03:17.706 --> 00:03:18.714
- So before getting into it,

00:03:18.714 --> 00:03:20.967
I want to tell you how I found you.

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:24.252
So, I used to always get sick, always.

00:03:24.252 --> 00:03:25.262
- Ah.
- I was always,

00:03:25.262 --> 00:03:27.762
and I always believed
that if you were sick,

00:03:27.762 --> 00:03:28.900
don't come close to me,
'cause I'm going to get sick.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.003
So on my team, if people were sick,

00:03:32.003 --> 00:03:33.759
like, stay home, don't come to
me, you're going to get sick.

00:03:33.759 --> 00:03:35.382
Then in January I got really, really sick,

00:03:35.382 --> 00:03:38.189
five days, just straight
hiccups, constantly,

00:03:38.189 --> 00:03:39.981
hiccups, hiccups, and then I decided

00:03:39.981 --> 00:03:41.553
I'm never going to get sick again,

00:03:41.553 --> 00:03:42.961
and I had to figure out
a way never to get sick,

00:03:42.961 --> 00:03:44.641
and then I stumbled across your work

00:03:44.641 --> 00:03:48.481
and what you were doing, said,
I'm going to give it a shot.

00:03:48.481 --> 00:03:51.925
And since then, I haven't
gotten sick since January.

00:03:51.925 --> 00:03:53.470
- Aha, hey, right on, man.
- To May 20th.

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:55.962
- Way to go man, way to go, way to go.

00:03:55.962 --> 00:03:59.295
That's cool.
(laughing)

