00:04:21.798 --> 00:04:24.752
Why are you doing this,
why it's important to you,

00:04:24.752 --> 00:04:26.273
it's not just about
setting the world records,

00:04:26.273 --> 00:04:27.823
but why do you do this?

00:04:27.823 --> 00:04:30.552
- Yes, as I've said, I
did a lot of stuff outside

00:04:30.552 --> 00:04:34.235
in nature, 'cause I felt this
disconnection from nature

00:04:34.235 --> 00:04:36.176
inside from the soul itself.

00:04:36.176 --> 00:04:40.775
Soul is not able to express and
you can see it in the world.

00:04:40.775 --> 00:04:42.938
Full of depression and
autoimmune diseases,

00:04:42.938 --> 00:04:47.105
cancer, all those things,
anxiety, so nobody knows

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:52.175
actually, it's because of
the disconnection of nature.

00:04:52.175 --> 00:04:55.186
So resulted in me in an awkward feeling,

00:04:55.186 --> 00:04:56.700
I don't know what there is,

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.162
but there's more than meets the eye.

00:04:59.162 --> 00:05:02.000
We going to show all those things,

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.167
native spirits had to subdue a
couple of hundred years here,

00:05:07.108 --> 00:05:09.576
now they are coming back through us,

00:05:09.576 --> 00:05:13.743
through the love, making sense
that Mother Nature is back.

00:05:16.132 --> 00:05:18.879
I'm going into a soul search.

00:05:18.879 --> 00:05:22.812
And that brought me to
all kinds of traditions,

00:05:22.812 --> 00:05:26.567
esoteric disciplines,
languages, religions,

00:05:26.567 --> 00:05:31.477
debates about philosophies,
cultures, anything, you know?

00:05:31.477 --> 00:05:34.977
But in the end, it didn't connect with me.

00:05:36.141 --> 00:05:38.221
That's where the cold water came in.

00:05:38.221 --> 00:05:41.169
And the cold water is
merciless but righteous.

00:05:41.169 --> 00:05:42.529
- Okay.
- So, boom, hey,

00:05:42.529 --> 00:05:44.116
you got to be there.
- Right.

00:05:44.116 --> 00:05:46.735
- But little by little, you
begin to wake up to that,

00:05:46.735 --> 00:05:51.038
what you feel inside,
it's beginning to wake up

00:05:51.038 --> 00:05:55.240
a real primordial, disconnection
is beginning to connect

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:59.073
to your consciousness,
brain, body connection.

00:06:00.279 --> 00:06:03.446
It was in the books, it was not there.

00:06:04.376 --> 00:06:07.239
And now we change the
books, in the university

00:06:07.239 --> 00:06:11.406
and all of the story began
