00:06:14.418 --> 00:06:17.736
And that after a lot of
esoteric disciplines,

00:06:17.736 --> 00:06:22.009
philosophies, traditions,
languages, religions,

00:06:22.009 --> 00:06:24.092
doctrines, yoga, kung fu,

00:06:25.928 --> 00:06:28.329
