00:07:42.374 --> 00:07:43.791
This is survival.

00:07:45.148 --> 00:07:48.635
So the story begins with a feeling,

00:07:48.635 --> 00:07:51.101
and I want you to feel with me.

00:07:51.101 --> 00:07:52.518
So let's breathe.

00:07:53.746 --> 00:07:55.808
