00:07:55.808 --> 00:07:56.641
Let it go.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:58.553
Fully in.

00:08:00.266 --> 00:08:02.183
Don't ask yourself how.

00:08:03.475 --> 00:08:07.144
Just always say, use any hole you got.

00:08:07.144 --> 00:08:11.227
(laughing)
Get it in, let it go.

00:08:12.634 --> 00:08:16.634
Ice water, it's fresh in
here, take it fully in.

00:08:24.542 --> 00:08:26.375
Halt and swim with me.

00:08:27.379 --> 00:08:28.575
Swim, come on.

00:08:28.575 --> 00:08:29.825
Move your arms.

00:08:34.797 --> 00:08:36.380
It's the hello one.

00:08:37.302 --> 00:08:39.135
This is Mother Nature.

00:08:42.717 --> 00:08:45.050
Swimming into her, rebirth,

00:08:49.465 --> 00:08:52.715
awakening the deepest within ourselves.

00:08:54.955 --> 00:08:57.227
I do not fear death.

00:08:57.227 --> 00:08:59.956
I fear not to live fully.

00:08:59.956 --> 00:09:02.589
If I live fully, I'm not into death.

00:09:02.589 --> 00:09:03.506
I'm living.

00:09:07.873 --> 00:09:12.040
The thing is, I lost over
there the fear of death.

00:09:15.587 --> 00:09:18.532
And that's where I found it.

00:09:18.532 --> 00:09:20.865
The fear of death no longer.

00:09:23.452 --> 00:09:27.597
And that made me able to
do very strange stuff.

00:09:27.597 --> 00:09:31.764
Like climbing Mount Everest
