is a natural element

00:10:13.515 --> 00:10:17.015
able to bring you right down to your core,

00:10:18.026 --> 00:10:21.776
the depth of the mystery
itself, called life.

00:10:23.026 --> 00:10:24.193
And loving it.

00:10:25.086 --> 00:10:27.750
So there I was, Mount Everest,

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:31.500
this is about 7060 meters
there, there I was,

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:37.947
sitting around, but there
I was, in the middle of it,

00:10:39.021 --> 00:10:40.974
I didn't know where I was,

00:10:40.974 --> 00:10:43.891
at 6000 so much meters, I was lost.

00:10:45.468 --> 00:10:46.995
I was lost.

00:10:46.995 --> 00:10:48.662
But not lost inside.

00:10:50.249 --> 00:10:52.604
This connection was there.

00:10:52.604 --> 00:10:54.160
I felt light.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:57.064
I felt no paranoid or anxiety.

00:10:57.064 --> 00:10:58.064
I felt okay.

00:10:59.503 --> 00:11:02.915
It's where I found, had
found, not in the books,

00:11:02.915 --> 00:11:05.748
once again, confidence and belief.

00:11:07.565 --> 00:11:09.652
It was really opened me up, I could climb

00:11:09.652 --> 00:11:13.341
the Mount Everest, I just had a good time

00:11:13.341 --> 00:11:16.551
for the rest of the days I was there.

00:11:16.551 --> 00:11:21.281
And now, after doing 26
of those world records,

00:11:21.281 --> 00:11:24.183
about numerous more
challenges, I've gotten

00:11:24.183 --> 00:11:28.948
encountered with scientists,
