00:11:28.948 --> 00:11:33.115
that I was awakening,
stimulating, and influencing

00:11:34.553 --> 00:11:38.562
systems within the body,
they thought of not being

00:11:38.562 --> 00:11:42.729
able to be influenced or
connected with for humans.

00:11:43.856 --> 00:11:45.819
They thought, hey, you
must cannot just tap in,

00:11:45.819 --> 00:11:49.240
it's autonomic nervous system,
but autonomy can process

00:11:49.240 --> 00:11:50.990
outside of our world.

00:11:52.001 --> 00:11:54.098
Brain body connection,
remember, connection

00:11:54.098 --> 00:11:58.167
and there it is, and
now I'm able to connect,

00:11:58.167 --> 00:12:00.935
enter, and make a difference,

00:12:00.935 --> 00:12:03.791
and that's what I did in those studies.

00:12:03.791 --> 00:12:05.485
- [Narrator] Wim's
mission is to use his body

00:12:05.485 --> 00:12:07.563
as a laboratory, to revolutionize

00:12:07.563 --> 00:12:10.104
our understanding of physiology.

00:12:10.104 --> 00:12:13.040
In 2011, he was injected with a bacterial

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.944
endotoxin in an experiment
that challenged our

00:12:15.944 --> 00:12:18.326
understanding of the nervous system.

00:12:18.326 --> 00:12:20.316
In normal humans, the
injection should cause

00:12:20.316 --> 00:12:22.873
a strong immune response,
leading to fever,

00:12:22.873 --> 00:12:25.369
chills, and headaches.

00:12:25.369 --> 00:12:26.822
But not in Wim.

00:12:26.822 --> 00:12:28.854
It appeared that he was somehow able

00:12:28.854 --> 00:12:30.941
to suppress his immune response

00:12:30.941 --> 00:12:32.940
by making his body secrete adrenaline,

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.647
suggesting that his method can allow us

00:12:35.647 --> 00:12:39.487
to influence our immune system at will.

00:12:39.487 --> 00:12:41.701
Scientists thought he might
just be a freak of nature.

00:12:41.701 --> 00:12:43.482
So to further prove this theory,

00:12:43.482 --> 00:12:45.420
they performed this same experiment

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:48.497
on 12 subjects Wim had trained in Poland,

00:12:48.497 --> 00:12:50.366
and the same thing happened.

00:12:50.366 --> 00:12:53.837
- Proof they only got
after competitive study

00:12:53.837 --> 00:12:57.421
with groups, so I took on a full group,

00:12:57.421 --> 00:13:02.220
I trained them, four days,
to get into the autonomic

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:04.414
nervous system and all those things,

00:13:04.414 --> 00:13:07.997
and they got administered
with the bacteria

00:13:09.779 --> 00:13:12.881
and as well, all within
a quarter of an hour

00:13:12.881 --> 00:13:15.048
entering into the systems.

00:13:16.686 --> 00:13:19.099
And now we are getting somewhere.

00:13:19.099 --> 00:13:21.079
Power of the mind.

00:13:21.079 --> 00:13:24.896
Yeah, we are dealing
in modern day society,

00:13:24.896 --> 00:13:28.078
we can go to the moon, we can go to Mars

00:13:28.078 --> 00:13:29.802
and everywhere, but we cannot tap

00:13:29.802 --> 00:13:32.534
into the depths of ourselves

00:13:32.534 --> 00:13:35.903
and make a difference
with deep depression,

00:13:35.903 --> 00:13:39.070
anxiety, fear, trauma, PTSD, anything.

00:13:41.634 --> 00:13:43.801
We don't control our mind.

00:13:45.258 --> 00:13:47.543
We are not able to embrace
the power of the mind

00:13:47.543 --> 00:13:50.876
while the mind is ongoing, going, going.

00:13:51.961 --> 00:13:56.653
Doesn't let us feel complete,
it is there all the time,

00:13:56.653 --> 00:13:59.521
now we turned the wheels.

00:13:59.521 --> 00:14:01.256
- Normally, it's very
difficult to increase

00:14:01.256 --> 00:14:04.388
your adrenaline levels by your own will.

00:14:04.388 --> 00:14:07.029
Adrenaline is released
by the autonomic nervous

00:14:07.029 --> 00:14:09.659
system, and autonomic means
you cannot voluntarily

00:14:09.659 --> 00:14:12.217
influence it, so if you walk outside

00:14:12.217 --> 00:14:15.375
and you are robbed on the street,

00:14:15.375 --> 00:14:17.831
you will have a heart rate
of 160, your blood pressure

00:14:17.831 --> 00:14:21.141
will be sky high within seconds.

00:14:21.141 --> 00:14:23.739
But if I ask you now to
increase your heart rate,

00:14:23.739 --> 00:14:25.682
you cannot do that.

00:14:25.682 --> 00:14:27.998
You cannot voluntarily modulate that.

00:14:27.998 --> 00:14:30.010
And with the techniques
of Wim Hof, we showed

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:33.466
that he was able to
increase his adrenaline

00:14:33.466 --> 00:14:35.562
levels to very high concentrations,

00:14:35.562 --> 00:14:37.477
even higher than people
that go bungee jumping

00:14:37.477 --> 00:14:39.303
for the first time.

00:14:39.303 --> 00:14:41.967
- They saw me doing all
kinds of strange stuff

00:14:41.967 --> 00:14:44.877
because what I was doing was not possible

00:14:44.877 --> 00:14:47.461
by the physiologists, and I did it,

00:14:47.461 --> 00:14:50.848
and so let's give him a shot,
and they gave me a shot.

00:14:50.848 --> 00:14:53.864
And so there I was, I proved it,

00:14:53.864 --> 00:14:56.949
and then I told, listen,
I'm not the only one.

00:14:56.949 --> 00:14:59.585
Everybody is able to do this.

00:14:59.585 --> 00:15:01.968
Everybody here is able to do this.

00:15:01.968 --> 00:15:03.270
What?

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:06.270
How much training these people need?

00:15:07.341 --> 00:15:09.515
A year, a year and a half?

00:15:09.515 --> 00:15:12.337
Before they are able to do do a little bit

00:15:12.337 --> 00:15:15.942
what you are able to do, what you showed?

00:15:15.942 --> 00:15:17.275
I said, 10 days.

00:15:18.627 --> 00:15:21.423
Just shook at that, like this, 10 days.

